      "message": "test: hole-op fixtures and examples state their tools' feeds (#2598)\n\nThe fixtures and the shipped examples gave drill and thread-mill ops a\nfeed above the tool's own feed. The post now refuses that, so each one\nstates the tool's feed. The router demo is saved again from its command\nbuild (WRITE_GOLDEN), and the example programs are posted again. Only\nthe drill F words of the programs change.\n\nAlso drops an unused `mut` in feed_rating.\n\nRefs #2598\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
