      "message": "Merge remote-tracking branch 'origin/main' into issue/2598-drill-thread-tool-feed\n\nConflict: examples/first-router-part.camproj. Took main's side, then\nsaved the demo again from its command build (WRITE_GOLDEN=1). Against\nmain, the file differs only in the Drill1 feeds (150 -> 115, params\nand cached moves), the Drill1, 2D Pocket1 and 2D Contour1 stamps (the\npocket and contour stamps read the drill), and the version (72, the\ncurrent PROJECT_VERSION on main).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
